subject: fix(db): WAL checkpoint TRUNCATE -> PASSIVE in node:sqlite + bun adapters too

The app can fall back to node:sqlite or bun:sqlite when better-sqlite3
is unavailable (native module version mismatch). All three adapters ran
wal_checkpoint(TRUNCATE) every 60s and on shutdown, so the event-loop
hang was present regardless of driver. Apply PASSIVE everywhere.

